        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44023</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44023"/>
        <updated>2026-05-06T18:35:31.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122352170?u=091ab980244274ed0342cf177e339f5c829027d7&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Add a "Constituent properties" section to the <code class="notranslate">background-repeat</code> page linking to <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-x</code> and <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-y</code>.</p>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-note" dir="auto"><p class="markdown-alert-title" dir="auto"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir="auto">I added a warning because from my understanding <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-x</code> and <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-y</code> were only ever supported in Safari from versions 5 to 10.1 and I couldn't find any statement about intent to implement it in any major browser. See discussion in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4114392662" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43512" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43512/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43512">#43512</a> for more info.<br>
As this is time sensitive information I tried to phrase it in the most general way.<br>
Of course feel free to rephrase, edit or remove this warning as you see fit.</p>
</div>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">A CSS property being a shorthand for other properties is interesting information.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto">The  <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-x</code> and <code class="notranslate">background-repeat-y</code> pages were added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3681078214" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42184" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42184/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42184">#42184</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>




<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #43512.">Closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4114392662" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43512" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43512/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43512">#43512</a></p>]]></content>
