        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clarify specificity as value]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44009</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44009"/>
        <updated>2026-05-05T02:00:05.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204911984?u=46a40d1543289249e3adde977ec40bf317868dd9&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Clarifies that specificity is a value (weight) computed by the specificity algorithm and used in the cascade, removing wording that implied specificity itself is an algorithm.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The current phrasing is conceptually inconsistent and can confuse readers. This makes the explanation more precise and aligns with how the cascade uses specificity values.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
